          "at": "2026-11-09T20:18:15.004Z",
          "html": "<p>Done, on <a href=\"#p-empty-sections-hide\">P69 · Empty Sections Hide</a>, where this belongs, not this phase: it answers that plan's open call about a hidden section taking its New button with it.</p>\n<ul>\n  <li>While you're reviewing, an empty section with a New button stays, with its header, a short line (\"Nothing to do\" for Todos, \"No questions\" for Questions) and its button.</li>\n  <li>That's five sections, not only Todos and Questions, because Issues, Manual tests and Phases have New buttons too.</li>\n  <li>The toolbar New menu is off the plan. Other empty sections still hide.</li>\n</ul>"
        }
